      hu: ["A város tengerszint feletti magassága 1609 méter.", "A Karamara-hágó a város nyugati bejáratánál 2000 méter fölé magasodik.", "A Jigjiga Egyetemet 2007-ben alapították.", "A város környéke Etiópia legnagyobb tevetenyésztő vidéke.", "A lakosság több mint 95%-a somáli etnikumú.", "Fontos vasúti és közúti kapcsolat tervezett a Berbera kikötő irányába.", "A városban található Etiópia egyik legnagyobb katonai bázisa.", "A város éves csapadékmennyisége mindössze 500-600 mm körül mozog."],
      ro: ["Altitudinea orașului este de 1.609 metri deasupra nivelului mării.", "Populația orașului a crescut de la 50.000 în 1994 la peste 160.000.", "Aeroportul Wilwal deservește zboruri zilnice către Addis Abeba.", "Jigjiga se află pe principala rută comercială Addis-Harar-Berbera.", "Munții Karamara sunt situați la vest de centrul orașului.", "Majoritatea locuitorilor urmează ramura sunnită a Islamului.", "Unitatea monetară Birr este folosită alături de tranzacții în dolari.", "Orașul a fost sediul guvernului regional Somali din 1995."],
      en: ["Jigjiga sits at an elevation of 1,609 meters (5,279 feet).", "The city was established as a modern town in 1891 by Ras Makonnen.", "The Karamara pass is a strategic mountain pass located nearby.", "Jigjiga University was founded in 2007 as part of national expansion.", "The city's international airport was recently upgraded to handle larger jets.", "Livestock trade accounts for over 60% of the regional economic activity.", "Jigjiga is approximately 630 kilometers east of Addis Ababa.", "The city serves as a hub for the Ogaden clan territories."],
