      en: ["Madda Walabu University was established in Robe in 2006.", "The city is situated at an elevation of 2,492 meters.", "Main gateway to the biodiversity-rich Bale Mountains National Park.", "Administrative capital of the Bale Zone in the Oromia Region.", "Served by the Robe Goba Airport for regional flights.", "Located within 100 km of the historic Sof Omar Caves."],
